{"tool_name":"fit-a-model-for-the-growth-of-yeast-cells","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>This notebook uses the <a href=\"https://github.com/ome/rOMERO-gateway\">rOMERO-gateway</a> and <a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/html/EBImage.html\">EBImage</a> to process an Image associated to the paper <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.17867/10000114\">'Timing of gene expression in a cell-fate decision system'</a>.</p>\n\n<p>The Image \"Pos22\" is taken from the dataset <a href=\"https://idr.openmicroscopy.org/webclient/?show=image-3491334\">idr0040-aymoz-singlecell/experimentA/YDA306_AGA1y_PRM1r_Mating</a>. It is a timelapse Image with 42 timepoints separated by 5 minutes. This Image is used to fit a model for the growth of the yeast cells. The notebook does not replicate any of the analysis of the above mentioned paper.</p>\n\n<p>Its purpose is mainly to demonstrate the use of Jupyter, rOMERO-gateway and EBimage.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>What it does:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>For each time point of one movie:\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Read the image for this time point&nbsp; from the IDR</li>\n\t\t<li>Threshold the images and count the cells using EBimage functions</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>Fit an exponential model to the count of cells against time to get a coefficient of grow (exponential factor)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>This notebook uses the <a href=\"https://github.com/ome/rOMERO-gateway\">rOMERO-gateway</a> and <a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/html/EBImage.html\">EBImage</a> to process an Image associated to the paper <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.17867/10000114\">'Timing of gene expression in a cell-fate decision system'</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Image \"Pos22\" is taken from the dataset <a href=\"https://idr.openmicroscopy.org/webclient/?show=image-3491334\">idr0040-aymoz-singlecell/experimentA/YDA306_AGA1y_PRM1r_Mating</a>. It is a timelapse Image with 42 timepoints separated by 5 minutes. This Image is used to fit a model for the growth of the yeast cells. The notebook does not replicate any of the analysis of the above mentioned paper.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Its purpose is mainly to demonstrate the use of Jupyter, rOMERO-gateway and EBimage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What it does:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>For each time point of one movie:\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li>Read the image for this time point&nbsp; from the IDR</li>\r\n\t\t<li>Threshold the images and count the cells using EBimage functions</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>Fit an exponential model to the count of cells against time to get a coefficient of grow (exponential factor)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-05-03T13:55:38+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-08-16T12:39:47+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1534424023,"last_comment_uid":1,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Open Microscopy Environment"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":4614,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"72557a5f-0e3d-4e03-898f-aea296452eaa","url":"/taxonomy/term/4614"}],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":1,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"ff7211b9-a937-4c33-aac3-22aa10053480","url":"/user/1"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4772,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2945","url":"/analysis"},{"target_id":4058,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Cell_counting","url":"/object-counting"}],"has_implementation":[{"target_id":4342,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"3cae1836